@startuml
title Interpreter / Expression Tree

skinparam legendBackgroundColor #f9f9f9
skinparam legendBorderColor #999999

legend right

**Intent**:
Represent grammar and interpret sentences.

**Motivation**:
Evaluate simple DSLs: arithmetic expressions, filters.

**Applicability**:
Simple grammars; frequent evaluation; parser is regular.

**Participants**:
Terminal/Nonterminal expressions compose; Context provides environment.

**Consequences**:
Pros: Easy to extend grammar; composable syntax tree.
Cons: Inefficient for complex grammars; many classes.

**Implementation Notes**:
Consider parser generators or Visitor for evaluation over AST.

**Known Uses**:
Regex engines; rule engines; query DSLs.

**Related Patterns**:
Composite (AST), Visitor (operations), Flyweight (shared nodes).

endlegend

class Context {
  +lookup(symbol:String)
}

interface AbstractExpression {
  +interpret(ctx: Context)
}

class TerminalExpression
class NonterminalExpression {
  -expressions : List<AbstractExpression>
  +interpret(ctx: Context)
}

AbstractExpression <|.. TerminalExpression
AbstractExpression <|.. NonterminalExpression
NonterminalExpression *-- AbstractExpression
@enduml